        <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-dollar w-5 text-center text-sun"></i>Scholarship cohorts with clear rules</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-award w-5 text-center text-sun"></i>Certificates you can verify</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> True Series Academy</p>
  </section>
  <section class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-10 sm:px-8">
    <div class="w-full max-w-md">
      <a href="/" class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-2.5 lg:hidden">
        <span class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink text-sun"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i></span>
        <span class="font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-ink">True Series Academy</span>
      </a>
